{"id":"94ded8b3ba316311","group":"28","path":"28/28-ex-one-time-pad.md","title":"一次一密的完美保密见证","display":"ex-one-time-pad — 一次一密的完美保密见证","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-ex-one-time-pad","aliases":["28-ex-one-time-pad"],"display":"ex-one-time-pad — 一次一密的完美保密见证","depends_on":["[[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §9.1; Exercise 9.1","source_printed_pages":"175,197","source_pdf_pages":"201,223","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-ex-one-time-pad"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-ex-one-time-pad</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-one-time-pad — 一次一密的完美保密见证"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"05773b5ac46bc2b8\" href=\"?note=05773b5ac46bc2b8\" title=\"28-df-perfect-secrecy\">28-df-perfect-secrecy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §9.1; Exercise 9.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"175,197"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"201,223"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 是等长二进制向量逐位模2加法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}\">\\(\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"05773b5ac46bc2b8\" href=\"?note=05773b5ac46bc2b8\" title=\"28-df-perfect-secrecy\">28-df-perfect-secrecy</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,x)\\coloneqq k\\oplus x,\\qquad\\operatorname{OTPDec}_n(k,y)\\coloneqq k\\oplus y\\qquad(k,x,y\\in\\Sigma^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,x)\\coloneqq k\\oplus x,\\qquad\\operatorname{OTPDec}_n(k,y)\\coloneqq k\\oplus y\\qquad(k,x,y\\in\\Sigma^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}(\\Sigma^n,\\Sigma^n,\\Sigma^n,\\operatorname{OTP}_n,\\operatorname{OTPDec}_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}(\\Sigma^n,\\Sigma^n,\\Sigma^n,\\operatorname{OTP}_n,\\operatorname{OTPDec}_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>k⊕(k⊕x)=x给出正确性。每个固定x,y恰有一个密钥k=x⊕y产生y，因此所有明文的密文都是均匀分布。n=0时三个集合均含唯一空串，结论也成立。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§9.1; Exercise 9.1；印刷 pp.175,197 / PDF pp.201,223。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-perfect-secrecy","status":"resolved","id":"05773b5ac46bc2b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-perfect-secrecy","status":"resolved","id":"05773b5ac46bc2b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\oplus$ 是等长二进制向量逐位模2加法；$\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}$ 见 [[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\oplus","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,x)\\coloneqq k\\oplus x,\\qquad\\operatorname{OTPDec}_n(k,y)\\coloneqq k\\oplus y\\qquad(k,x,y\\in\\Sigma^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}(\\Sigma^n,\\Sigma^n,\\Sigma^n,\\operatorname{OTP}_n,\\operatorname{OTPDec}_n).","display":true}],"bytes":1456,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-314","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]、[[28-ex-one-time-pad]]、[[28-thm-perfect-secrecy-key-bound]]、[[28-df-one-way-permutation]]、[[28-thm-ggm-prf]]、[[28-prop-one-time-pad-key-reuse]]。"},{"id":"287f5a015dc5ca38","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$k,x,x',y,y'\\in\\Sigma^n$；$\\operatorname{OTP}_n$ 见 [[28-ex-one-time-pad]]；$\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}$ 见 [[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]。"}],"outgoing":["05773b5ac46bc2b8"]}